    },
    "Image models require an API key from the same provider.\nYou can also set these up later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图像模型需要同一提供商的 API 密钥。\n你也可以稍后在设置中配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the CLI and sign in once; the sidebar section appears automatically. For examples, Claude Code: npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code, then run claude in a terminal to log in. Codex: npm install -g @openai/codex, then codex login. Either agent runs fully inside SipAI once it is signed in; before that its sessions list read-only." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: agent CLI setup",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装 CLI 并登录一次，侧边栏对应的区块就会自动出现。例如，Claude Code：npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code，然后在终端运行 claude 登录。Codex：npm install -g @openai/codex，然后 codex login。两个智能体只要登录，就能完全在 SipAI 内部运行；在此之前它的会话只以只读方式列出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted — the reply was stopped before it arrived." : {
      "comment" : "Chat banner after the user stops an in-flight reply",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已中断——回复在到达前被停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted — this turn was stopped before it finished." : {
      "comment" : "Transcript row after the user stops a running turn",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已中断——这一回合在完成前被停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its stored API key is deleted permanently. Its models stay and can be re-linked by adding the provider again." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the Remove Provider confirmation",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其存储的 API 密钥将被永久删除。它的模型会保留，重新添加该提供商后即可重新关联。"
          }
        }
      }
