    "Sidebar" : {
      "comment" : "Settings: header of the sidebar display toggles",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "侧边栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI asks updates.sipai.dev once a day whether a newer version exists. Nothing is downloaded until you choose to install it, and no usage data, account or system profile is ever sent." : {
      "comment" : "Updates pane: what the automatic check does",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 每天向 updates.sipai.dev 查询一次是否有新版本。在你选择安装之前不会下载任何内容，也不会发送任何使用数据、账号或系统概况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI could not write this note's file. Your changes are still here — they will be saved again on the next edit." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip explaining the note save failure badge",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 无法写入这条笔记的文件。你的修改仍然保留——下次编辑时会再次尝试保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SipAI is completely a local tool. Chats, notes, roles, and settings live in ~/Library/Application Support/SipAI, and API keys stay in that folder's config.json on your disk. Messages are sent only to the provider of the model you picked — there is no server in between. Agent sessions are stored by the CLIs themselves, under ~/.claude, ~/.codex and ~/.kimi-code." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: data storage and privacy",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SipAI 完全是一个本地工具。对话、笔记、角色和设置保存在 ~/Library/Application Support/SipAI，API 密钥保存在该文件夹的 config.json 中，都在你自己的磁盘上。消息只会发送给你所选模型的提供商——中间没有任何服务器。智能体会话则由各 CLI 自己保存在 ~/.claude、~/.codex 和 ~/.kimi-code 下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sipping…" : {
      "comment" : "Shown while waiting for the model",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
