      }
    },
    "The run exited with code %d." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: nonzero exit",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次运行已退出，退出码 %d。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SipAI mark and wordmark at the top of the sidebar. Turn it off to give the section list that room." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: sidebar brand toggle help text",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "侧边栏顶部的 SipAI 图标和文字标志。关闭后可以把这块空间让给下方的区块列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system prompt (Settings → Prompt and Roles) is the standing instruction sent with every chat message. Roles are named prompts you can switch between, so the same chat window can answer as a code reviewer, translator, or tutor. One starter role ships with the app as a worked example — edit it, delete it, or add your own." : {
      "comment" : "FAQ answer: system prompt and roles",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统提示词（「设置 → 提示词与角色」）是随每条对话消息一起发送的常驻指令。角色则是一组具名的提示词，你可以随时切换，让同一个对话窗口分别以代码审查员、翻译或老师的身份回答。App 内置了一个角色作为示例——你可以修改它、删除它，或添加自己的角色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task file could not be written." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-task error: SKILL.md write failed",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入任务文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task has no prompt to run." : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: SKILL.md body is empty",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该任务没有可运行的任务描述。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task's folder no longer exists: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Scheduled-run failure: cwd is gone",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该任务的文件夹已不存在：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn is still running, but nothing has come back for 3 minutes. This may be fine. However, if it persists for too long, it may indicate a blocked or misconfigured network route, which looks exactly like this because the agent retries in silence — agent CLIs read the HTTP_PROXY and HTTPS_PROXY environment variables and ignore the macOS system proxy setting." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the stalled-turn notice",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这一回合仍在运行，但已经有 3 分钟没有任何返回。这可能没有问题；但如果持续太久，就可能是网络线路被拦截或配置有误——出现这种情况时看起来正是如此，因为智能体会静默重试：智能体 CLI 只读取 HTTP_PROXY 和 HTTPS_PROXY 环境变量，并不会理会 macOS 的系统代理设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing before that message to branch from." : {
      "comment" : "Branch error when the chosen message is the first one",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "那条消息之前没有可供分支的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items could not be removed and may still hold your data: %@. Everything else was reset." : {
      "comment" : "Body when a factory reset could not remove some files",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以下项目无法移除，可能仍保存着你的数据：%@。其余内容都已重置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These names appear above each message. Leave any field blank to fall back to the default." : {
      "comment" : "Labels pane help text",
